 models that provide valuable customer insights to drive higher levels of sales conversion.\n\nOneMagnify’s commitment to employee growth and development extends far beyond typical approaches. We take great pride in fostering an environment where each of our 700+ colleagues can thrive and achieve their personal best. OneMagnify has been recognized as a Top Workplace, Best Workplace and Cool Workplace in the United States for 10 consecutive years and recently was recognized as a Top Workplace in India.\n\nOur AI team is seeking a client-facing Technical AI Engineer who is passionate about building strong client partnerships and delivering exceptional outcomes. This role is ideal for a highly organized professional who thrives in collaborative environments and is motivated by outstanding client delivery.\n\nThe AI Engineer will support the development and deployment of AI initiatives while ensuring high-quality execution, timely delivery, and a consistently high level of service for our clients.\n\nAbout You: \n\nA skilled multi-tasker who can prioritize and consistently balance multiple tasks with a highly developed sense of accountability and effortless ability to make significant contributions to initiativesA go-getter with unrivaled proactivity paired with a positive, can-do attitude who thrives in a fast-paced environmentA natural-born communicator, connecting the dots when others cannot and simplifying sophisticated issuesA genuine people-person who lives for building relationships and excels in collaboration modeAn experienced consultant with extraordinary communication, interpersonal, organizational, and project/time management skillsWhat you’ll do:As a technical developer our AI team, work with strategic clients to help them utilize their data to take actionStay up-to-date on the latest AI tools and featuresProvide Technical solutioning for our generative AI projectsParticipate in code reviews and solutioning sessions with our data scientists, ai engineers, software engineers, and other technical resourcesLead cross-functional projects and enable collaboration across artificial intelligence and OneMagnify\n\n\nWhat you’ll need:\n\nBachelor’s degree from a four-year college or university. Master's degree preferred.Experience with Data Science, Artificial Intelligence, and Large Language ModelsObject-oriented programming experienceWorking knowledge of DataBricks2+ years in a technical role with experience leading projects. 2+ years if educational level is masters.Solid understanding of data analytics and business intelligence tools such as Python, R, SQL, Domo, Tableau, and PowerBIExpert presentation skills\n\n\nBenefits\n\nWe offer a comprehensive benefits package including medical, dental, 401(k), paid holidays, vacations, and more.\n\nAbout Us\n\nWhether it’s awareness, advocacy, engagement, or efficacy, we move brands forward with work that connects with audiences and delivers results. Through meaningful analytics, engaging communications and innovative technology solutions, we help clients tackle their most ambitious projects and overcome their biggest challenges.\n\nWe are an equal opportunity employer\n\nWe believe that Innovative ideas and solutions start with unique perspectives. That’s why we’re committed to providing every employee a workplace that’s free of discrimination and intolerance. We’re proud to be an equal opportunity employer and actively search for like-minded people to join our team.\n\nWe will ensure that individuals with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodation to participate in the job application or interview process, to perform job functions, and to receive benefits and privileges of employment. Please contact us to request accommodation.","attributesV2":[{"start":1403,"length":13,"detailData":{"jobPostingName":null,"hyperlink":null,"profileFamiliarName":null,"color":null,"companyName":null,"icon":null,"epoch":null,"systemImage":null,"textLink":null,"listItemStyle":null,"groupName":n