f-the-art resources.\nRole Summary\n Due to strategic growth initiatives, Our Client is seeking a talented Python / React AI Engineer. This role is pivotal in developing advanced AI-driven applications, enabling the company to remain at the forefront of technological advancements. The successful candidate will have the opportunity to work on exciting projects that have a substantial impact on both the company and its clientele, utilising the latest technologies and frameworks.\nResponsibilities\n As a Python / React AI Engineer, you will be expected to:Design and implement scalable AI applications using Python and React.Collaborate with cross-functional teams to define, design, and deliver new features.Engage in code reviews and maintain high code quality standards.Troubleshoot and resolve technical issues that arise during the software development lifecycle.Stay updated with emerging technologies and industry trends to enhance product functionality.\nEssential Skills & Experience\n The ideal candidate will possess:Strong proficiency in Python and React development.Experience with AI frameworks and machine learning concepts.Solid understanding of software development best practices and design patterns.Proven ability to work in a collaborative team environment, delivering projects on time and to specification.Excellent problem-solving skills and attention to detail.\nDesirable Skills & Experience\n While not mandatory, the following skills would be advantageous:Familiarity with cloud-based technologies and services.Experience with DevOps practices and CI/CD pipelines.Exposure to Agile development methodologies.Knowledge of additional programming languages is a plus.\nCall to Action\n If you are a skilled Python / React AI Engineer looking to make a significant impact within a forward-thinking organisation, we invite you to apply. Please submit your CV for consideration. Join Our Client in shaping the future of technology!","attributesV2":[{"start":2,"length":465,"det